WEBVTT

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.875
<i>Your cabin</i>
<i>in the Singapore office is ready.</i>

00:00:10.958 --> 00:00:12.125
<i>Did you see the photos?</i>

00:00:12.625 --> 00:00:14.208
<i>The team's excited to meet you.</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.083
Soon, Vineet.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.208
You know,

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:22.083
it could take two or three weeks
to hand over the Mukherjee case files.

00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:24.667
<i>Let me just remind you, Madam Tripathi,</i>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.417
<i>that opening the Singapore office</i>
<i>was your idea, not mine.</i>

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.833
I know, I know.

00:00:31.042 --> 00:00:33.167
<i>By the way, I miss you.</i>

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:35.792
Me too.

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:38.792
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:00:39.417 --> 00:00:41.000
<i>You seem a bit lost.</i>

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:45.417
No.

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:49.208
I'm just thinking about
some old cases that got me this far.

00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:52.667
<i>Alright, I need to go now.</i>

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.875
<i>I'll call you later, okay?</i>

00:00:55.792 --> 00:00:56.750
<i>Love you.</i>

00:00:57.792 --> 00:00:58.875
Yeah, me too.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.375
Bye.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:01.917
<i>Bye.</i>

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:21.583
<i>Hey, guys! I'm here at the Musafir Cafe.</i>

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:23.333
<i>And guess who I have with me here?</i>

00:01:23.417 --> 00:01:26.583
<i>The founders themselves,</i>
<i>Chander and Preeti.</i>

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:29.625
<i>Well, this is a beautiful space</i>
<i>you guys have created.</i>

00:01:29.708 --> 00:01:30.917
<i>- Thank you.</i>
<i>- Thank you.</i>

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.583
<i>Tell me, how did you come up with</i>
<i>the name "Musafir Cafe"?</i>

00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:40.708
<i>Actually, someone gifted me this name</i>
<i>many years ago.</i>

00:01:41.292 --> 00:01:44.125
<i>- When this cafe was just a little dream.</i>
<i>- Wow.</i>

00:01:44.208 --> 00:01:48.667
<i>And what about this famous promise wall?</i>
<i>Tell us what makes it so special?</i>

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.167
{\an8}- Good morning.
- Good morning.

00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:35.083
{\an8}Slept well?

00:02:37.917 --> 00:02:38.917
{\an8}Come, sit.

00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:53.250
You remembered?

00:02:53.917 --> 00:02:55.750
I never forget anything, madam.

00:02:56.583 --> 00:02:59.000
Especially not the opening day
of our cafe.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.458
- Happy three to us.
- Happy three to us.

00:03:04.542 --> 00:03:05.625
Come here.

00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:12.625
C, this is precious. I love it!

00:03:12.708 --> 00:03:13.667
Happy?

00:03:17.542 --> 00:03:18.625
C…

00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:22.417
Sometimes, I think about

00:03:23.042 --> 00:03:25.250
what would've happened
if we hadn't met five years ago

00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:27.375
and lived together
during the lockdown.

00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:30.958
You know this…

00:03:31.458 --> 00:03:32.667
Yeah. Yeah.

00:03:33.708 --> 00:03:34.917
Anyway, I was just thinking.

00:03:36.292 --> 00:03:37.750
Mark & Nilima's home?

00:03:39.208 --> 00:03:41.167
We can use it for the artist residency.

00:03:46.542 --> 00:03:47.833
Really?

00:03:47.917 --> 00:03:50.833
Yeah. I think it'll be perfect,
but you take your time.

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:57.542
Nervous?

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:00.750
Great.

00:04:00.833 --> 00:04:03.875
A little nervousness before starting
anything new is great.

00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:06.792
And I know what we exactly need
for this moment, so just hang on.

00:04:07.583 --> 00:04:10.458
- Where are you going?
- One sec. One sec.

00:04:24.917 --> 00:04:27.167
Let me do the honors.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:29.542
Here you go.

00:04:33.708 --> 00:04:34.750
I'm too good!

00:04:35.417 --> 00:04:37.917
Thomas Bakery. Tripura. Same.

00:04:38.417 --> 00:04:39.417
It's too good.

00:04:40.083 --> 00:04:41.875
- We should do this more often.
- Yeah.

00:04:46.458 --> 00:04:47.708
What are you thinking?

00:04:47.792 --> 00:04:49.875
I'm not thinking, just…

00:04:50.792 --> 00:04:53.375
Just reminiscing about…

00:04:54.792 --> 00:04:56.917
the lockdown days,
stuck together in one room,

00:04:57.792 --> 00:05:00.333
spending so much time with each other.

00:05:04.083 --> 00:05:07.833
I would only talk about Musafir Cafe,
and you would talk about traveling.

00:05:10.583 --> 00:05:12.667
You wanted to see Sri Lanka.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:15.500
You wanted to go to Thailand
and learn scuba diving.

00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:16.542
C…

00:05:21.708 --> 00:05:23.667
the traveler in me hasn't died.

00:05:25.333 --> 00:05:27.292
She's just taken a break for a while.

00:05:29.583 --> 00:05:31.208
Yeah, I know.

00:05:32.792 --> 00:05:36.875
What I mean to say is, you've made
Musafir Cafe what it is today, but…

00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:43.000
promise me that you'll never compromise
on your dreams because of me.

00:05:51.667 --> 00:05:53.167
Dreams can change too.

00:05:55.292 --> 00:05:56.917
They can evolve.

00:05:58.208 --> 00:05:59.292
Right?

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.458
Chander, aren't these beautiful?

00:06:25.708 --> 00:06:26.708
Newlyweds, right?

00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:29.125
I'll offer you a special rate of 550.

00:06:29.208 --> 00:06:31.417
- Make it 350.
- Nothing less than 400.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.292
The man's a newlywed.
How's he supposed to afford that?

00:06:34.375 --> 00:06:36.292
Make it 380. Okay?

00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:38.583
- Okay. Take it.
- Thank you.

00:06:38.667 --> 00:06:40.125
Sir, a couple's photo?

00:06:40.208 --> 00:06:42.333
- No, thanks, I have a camera.
- Sir, a couple's photo.

00:06:42.417 --> 00:06:43.625
Look at this beautiful weather!

00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:44.833
You're right.

00:06:44.917 --> 00:06:47.750
We have to get a couple's photo.
Come on, we deserve one photo.

00:06:47.833 --> 00:06:50.000
- What are you doing?
- The view is so lovely, Chander!

00:06:50.083 --> 00:06:51.292
It'll be a great memory.

00:06:51.833 --> 00:06:53.708
Sir, please move a bit closer to her.

00:06:53.792 --> 00:06:54.917
How much closer?

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:55.958
Just a little bit.

00:06:56.042 --> 00:06:58.542
What's wrong, Sharma <i>ji?</i>
Are you feeling shy?

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:03.042
That's more like it!

00:07:03.125 --> 00:07:04.897
Now look at each other romantically, sir.

00:07:06.167 --> 00:07:07.167
Romantically.

00:07:11.667 --> 00:07:13.042
Sir, do you want one copy or two?

00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:16.667
- Two.
- Okay.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:20.125
This would make a beautiful location
for your cafe.

00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:23.958
It's perfect.

00:07:26.625 --> 00:07:29.833
Yeah, it's perfect here
right now, with you.

00:07:31.625 --> 00:07:33.000
But for my cafe,

00:07:33.792 --> 00:07:35.083
I'll find an even better place.

00:07:37.167 --> 00:07:40.000
<i>You're like the air my heart breathes in</i>

00:07:40.083 --> 00:07:42.833
<i>Having you is all I need</i>

00:07:42.917 --> 00:07:47.250
<i>No one else could do what you have done</i>

00:07:48.542 --> 00:07:54.000
<i>The closer I get to you</i>
<i>The more I bloom</i>

00:07:54.625 --> 00:07:58.917
<i>You've found your way</i>
<i>Into every part of me</i>

00:08:00.208 --> 00:08:05.333
<i>I'm only a wanderer, just the same as you</i>

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:10.500
<i>How can I vow I'll never drift away?</i>

00:08:10.583 --> 00:08:15.500
<i>And yet, my love, I've become yours</i>

00:08:16.083 --> 00:08:21.792
<i>I've become yours, my love</i>

00:08:21.875 --> 00:08:27.833
<i>I've become yours</i>

00:08:27.917 --> 00:08:32.458
<i>My love</i>

00:08:33.417 --> 00:08:38.500
<i>Oh, love of mine</i>

00:08:39.292 --> 00:08:44.500
<i>- Oh, love of mine</i>
<i>- My love</i>

00:08:44.583 --> 00:08:50.500
<i>I've become yours</i>

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.667
<i>My love</i>

00:08:57.208 --> 00:08:59.714
Okay, but what about
those two places we saw?

00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:03.042
Okay, perfect.

00:09:03.125 --> 00:09:04.792
Yeah, so how much will the rent be?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:08.875
And the deposit?

00:09:10.958 --> 00:09:13.417
Thank you. Thank you, Pankaj.
I'll call you back.

00:09:15.708 --> 00:09:18.042
Looks like I'll be going back alone.

00:09:19.708 --> 00:09:21.542
Not at all, madam.

00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:25.542
I can't tell you.
It's all so clear in my head right now.

00:09:25.625 --> 00:09:26.708
- Really?
- Yeah.

00:09:26.792 --> 00:09:27.833
Wow!

00:09:29.958 --> 00:09:30.917
Go ahead.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.792
Pankaj, that broker we met?

00:09:35.583 --> 00:09:38.125
He says we'll find something
in the next three months.

00:09:38.208 --> 00:09:39.500
- What?
- Yeah.

00:09:40.375 --> 00:09:41.750
I just have to take out a loan,

00:09:41.833 --> 00:09:45.583
but the best thing is that
my boss is willing to be my guarantor.

00:09:45.667 --> 00:09:47.083
Chander!

00:09:47.167 --> 00:09:48.250
Yes!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:52.917
Just imagine this, Sudha.

00:09:53.875 --> 00:09:58.625
Your first cup of tea every morning
made by me, right here in these mountains.

00:09:59.958 --> 00:10:01.542
It feels perfect, doesn't it?

00:10:07.542 --> 00:10:10.542
You know, it already feels like
time has stopped here.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:15.583
Like all the noise of the world has been
left far behind beneath these mountains.

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:20.542
Can I tell you a secret?

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:24.167
I've never been to the mountains before.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:25.333
Really?

00:10:26.792 --> 00:10:28.708
- Can I tell you another secret?
- Please.

00:10:30.375 --> 00:10:33.958
This is my first trip ever with a guy.

00:10:34.833 --> 00:10:38.125
Chander, I never even imagined that

00:10:38.208 --> 00:10:40.583
I would wake up to a morning like this.

00:10:41.375 --> 00:10:42.958
Imagine.

00:10:43.792 --> 00:10:45.625
You and me,

00:10:46.125 --> 00:10:48.875
right here in these mountains,

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.667
forever and ever.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.000
Chander…

00:11:00.417 --> 00:11:01.875
Breakfast is ready.

00:11:02.625 --> 00:11:04.208
But no hurry. Take your time.

00:11:06.875 --> 00:11:08.125
You were saying?

00:11:08.792 --> 00:11:10.292
No. It can wait.

00:11:10.875 --> 00:11:12.833
Good morning. How are you?

00:11:12.917 --> 00:11:14.750
- Very well.
- Did you sleep okay?

00:11:14.833 --> 00:11:16.125
- Yes.
- Mark?

00:11:16.208 --> 00:11:17.917
- Yes?
- Jam?

00:11:18.542 --> 00:11:20.292
Jam is on the table, love.

00:11:20.375 --> 00:11:21.625
Okay, okay.

00:11:21.708 --> 00:11:23.833
I have to just go quickly and come back.

00:11:27.417 --> 00:11:28.958
- Hey!
- Hello, good morning.

00:11:29.042 --> 00:11:31.042
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.917
- Come.
- Oh, thank you.

00:11:36.458 --> 00:11:37.750
- Start.
- Yeah.

00:11:38.583 --> 00:11:40.292
You two are so cute together.

00:11:40.375 --> 00:11:41.792
Really?

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:45.792
- Can I ask you two something?
- Yes, of course.

00:11:45.875 --> 00:11:48.000
Have you two never thought about…

00:11:49.583 --> 00:11:51.708
What? Getting married?

00:11:51.792 --> 00:11:53.667
- Yeah.
- Good question.

00:11:54.333 --> 00:11:57.375
I think we should just do it today.
Let's do it this evening.

00:11:57.458 --> 00:12:00.375
You guys are also here.
What do you think?

00:12:00.458 --> 00:12:02.875
No, I don't want to marry you.

00:12:03.542 --> 00:12:05.542
See? This is why.

00:12:06.125 --> 00:12:08.625
I learned this from my previous marriage.

00:12:09.125 --> 00:12:12.667
That these legal papers, this society,

00:12:13.167 --> 00:12:15.333
they can't bind two people together.

00:12:17.292 --> 00:12:19.125
The only thing that binds is love.

00:12:24.708 --> 00:12:26.208
And how did you two meet?

00:12:29.542 --> 00:12:30.583
So…

00:12:31.833 --> 00:12:34.583
after my ex-wife passed away,

00:12:34.667 --> 00:12:38.125
I spent a few years with my kids
in California,

00:12:38.208 --> 00:12:40.917
and then they left for college.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.375
I didn't like being alone there.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:49.667
So, I came to India. And as soon as
I got to India, I met her in Rishikesh.

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:53.042
And I never thought that, you know,
I could find love again.

00:12:53.125 --> 00:12:55.000
But when I looked at her…

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.292
Yeah.

00:12:59.333 --> 00:13:00.208
Yeah.

00:13:02.042 --> 00:13:03.958
And I didn't care about society.

00:13:04.042 --> 00:13:07.208
People can think whatever they want.
I still don't care.

00:13:07.292 --> 00:13:11.125
But it takes a lot of courage
to make decisions like that, right?

00:13:15.375 --> 00:13:16.458
I…

00:13:17.333 --> 00:13:19.208
I chose myself.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:25.875
Actually, our heart always knows
what's right.

00:13:25.958 --> 00:13:26.958
Yeah.

00:13:27.042 --> 00:13:30.125
It's the mind
that overthinks things later.

00:13:31.292 --> 00:13:32.458
Yeah.

00:13:35.292 --> 00:13:37.792
By the way, you know, his dream
is here in these mountains.

00:13:38.625 --> 00:13:39.875
- Really?
- Yeah.

00:13:39.958 --> 00:13:42.000
He wants to open his own cafe.

00:13:42.667 --> 00:13:44.417
You two could even help him, right?

00:13:45.292 --> 00:13:47.417
That's Mark's area of expertise.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.958
Maybe he can help you.

00:13:49.042 --> 00:13:50.708
- Happy to help.
- Thank you.

00:13:51.583 --> 00:13:53.583
Opening a cafe sounds dreamy,

00:13:53.667 --> 00:13:58.167
but running a cafe in these mountains
can beat you down.

00:13:58.667 --> 00:14:01.458
Unless you know for sure

00:14:01.958 --> 00:14:04.375
why you're doing it.

00:14:05.875 --> 00:14:07.667
Yeah, I…

00:14:08.667 --> 00:14:09.625
I understand

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.792
that mountains are tough.

00:14:13.583 --> 00:14:16.958
But living someone else's life in the city
is far tougher, right?

00:14:19.083 --> 00:14:23.583
And anyway,
here in the mountains, with Sudha,

00:14:23.667 --> 00:14:25.625
I feel much more like myself now.

00:14:26.167 --> 00:14:27.042
So, yeah.

00:14:27.125 --> 00:14:29.250
The mountains don't change us.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:35.000
They just show you
who you really are.

00:14:37.167 --> 00:14:39.375
Yeah. So true.

00:14:42.625 --> 00:14:44.000
What do you think, Sudha?

00:14:44.833 --> 00:14:46.125
How do you feel here?

00:14:47.708 --> 00:14:48.875
I…

00:14:51.292 --> 00:14:53.542
I feel free.

00:14:55.083 --> 00:14:56.250
I feel free.

00:14:57.167 --> 00:14:58.083
But…

00:15:02.208 --> 00:15:03.833
Your mountains are very beautiful.

00:15:06.208 --> 00:15:07.250
That's true.

00:15:08.625 --> 00:15:11.417
- So, you guys enjoy the breakfast.
- Thank you.

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:13.750
If you need anything,
you know where to find us.

00:15:13.833 --> 00:15:15.417
- Sure.
- Alright.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:19.208
- Come on, let's focus on lunch.
- Lunch?

00:15:19.292 --> 00:15:20.292
Yes.

00:15:26.542 --> 00:15:30.375
Chander, I didn't
want to tell you here, but…

00:15:32.125 --> 00:15:34.000
I've accepted the job offer in Mumbai.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.250
When?

00:15:39.333 --> 00:15:41.458
Your mom was here,
and there was so much going on.

00:15:41.542 --> 00:15:44.333
I just didn't get a chance to tell you.
And then after that, I was…

00:15:48.125 --> 00:15:50.458
Chander, listen to me, okay?

00:15:52.042 --> 00:15:53.958
It's the perfect opportunity.

00:15:54.958 --> 00:15:58.958
I'm getting the opportunity to specialize
in civil disputes at the Family Court.

00:15:59.875 --> 00:16:02.083
Big cases, a big law firm.

00:16:02.167 --> 00:16:06.583
And the starting salary alone is more
than what I'd make in Bhopal in two years.

00:16:06.667 --> 00:16:07.833
Can you imagine?

00:16:08.458 --> 00:16:11.542
Just think about how much
I'd be able to do for Mom.

00:16:11.625 --> 00:16:14.333
And, Chander,
all my dreams will come true.

00:16:19.167 --> 00:16:20.792
Chander, I couldn't say no this time.

00:16:26.208 --> 00:16:27.667
When do you start?

00:16:28.208 --> 00:16:29.250
In three weeks.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:34.156
Chander, you know…

00:16:35.833 --> 00:16:38.583
if I had discussed this with you…

00:16:40.456 --> 00:16:42.506
I don't think I could've
gone through with this decision.

00:16:43.042 --> 00:16:45.667
And you know how important
this is to me, right?

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:46.625
Yeah.

00:16:48.458 --> 00:16:49.458
Yeah.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:54.750
So, we won't make any changes
to the downstairs spaces.

00:16:54.833 --> 00:16:57.000
We'll… we'll retain its charm.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:01.542
As for the first-floor rooms, we'll just
convert them into concept rooms.

00:17:01.625 --> 00:17:04.000
And that's going to be
especially for artists and residents

00:17:04.083 --> 00:17:05.542
who are here for a reason.

00:17:07.333 --> 00:17:08.833
That sounds perfect.

00:17:08.917 --> 00:17:10.875
I still can't believe you're leaving.

00:17:12.625 --> 00:17:15.333
Since when did this guy
become so emotional, man?

00:17:15.958 --> 00:17:18.125
Chander, I worry for you.

00:17:18.208 --> 00:17:20.667
If you're so worried, then stay back.

00:17:28.708 --> 00:17:31.417
By the way, I still feel you two

00:17:31.917 --> 00:17:35.292
should use Nilima's and my bedroom
as one of the guest rooms.

00:17:35.375 --> 00:17:36.500
- No!
- Why not?

00:17:36.583 --> 00:17:37.583
No, we agreed.

00:17:37.667 --> 00:17:40.042
That room will always be reserved for you.

00:17:40.125 --> 00:17:41.917
- You'll come back as promised.
- But…

00:17:42.458 --> 00:17:46.958
I've already donated this house
to the Musafir Cafe trust.

00:17:47.042 --> 00:17:48.875
Uncle, you know that's not happening.

00:17:52.208 --> 00:17:53.125
Okay.

00:17:53.625 --> 00:17:55.500
As you wish. I resign.

00:17:56.583 --> 00:17:57.500
But…

00:17:59.833 --> 00:18:02.125
So, these are the papers. I signed them.

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:05.125
You keep them.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.458
There's something--

00:18:14.542 --> 00:18:16.917
I think I forgot something.

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.208
I'm forgetting something…

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:20.667
No, no, no. I'll go and check.

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.083
- Yeah?
- Yeah? Thank you, Preeti.

00:18:24.292 --> 00:18:25.250
I need to talk to you.

00:18:29.292 --> 00:18:31.917
You see, there's no one like Preeti.

00:18:32.417 --> 00:18:35.125
She's at home here with you, right?

00:18:35.208 --> 00:18:36.083
Yeah.

00:18:36.625 --> 00:18:37.958
I have something for you.

00:18:46.333 --> 00:18:47.542
- No.
- Why not?

00:18:47.625 --> 00:18:50.375
- This is yours.
- No. It's Nilima's.

00:18:50.458 --> 00:18:53.958
And I know how much she would have loved
for you to give this to Preeti.

00:18:54.042 --> 00:18:55.167
She loved Preeti.

00:18:55.917 --> 00:19:00.000
Preeti is a once-in-a-lifetime
kind of a partner.

00:19:00.625 --> 00:19:04.167
You understand that, right?

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.542
- Hi. Missing something?
- Oh!

00:19:06.625 --> 00:19:09.458
I forgot my passport! Oh my God!

00:19:09.542 --> 00:19:11.583
I'm getting old, I guess.

00:20:59.667 --> 00:21:00.958
Did you book the ticket?

00:21:01.667 --> 00:21:02.542
What?

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:05.708
Did you book a ticket to Mumbai?

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.042
No.

00:21:08.792 --> 00:21:11.667
First, I have to visit Mom,
wrap up some pending cases,

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:12.833
and then I will.

00:21:21.958 --> 00:21:26.292
Ever since I told you about Mumbai,
you've been acting very weird with me.

00:21:26.583 --> 00:21:27.458
Weird how?

00:21:27.958 --> 00:21:29.625
Like I'm leaving you.

00:21:29.708 --> 00:21:31.667
- You are leaving.
- No.

00:21:33.708 --> 00:21:35.333
I'm just going to Mumbai, Chander.

00:21:35.417 --> 00:21:36.333
Not Mars.

00:21:39.167 --> 00:21:41.375
That's just something people say, Sudha.

00:21:43.292 --> 00:21:44.708
Everything will be over.

00:21:44.792 --> 00:21:45.708
What will be over?

00:21:46.208 --> 00:21:48.000
I'll be there, you'll be here.

00:21:48.083 --> 00:21:51.792
We'll meet on weekends and holidays.
We'll make it work.

00:21:57.333 --> 00:21:58.667
Hey, Mr. America!

00:22:00.208 --> 00:22:01.875
I'm not your ex.

00:22:02.708 --> 00:22:03.958
We'll make it work.

00:22:04.833 --> 00:22:06.500
Long-distance relationship.

00:22:18.208 --> 00:22:19.667
Sudha, I've quit my job.

00:22:20.208 --> 00:22:22.583
- What?
- Yes, I've quit my job.

00:22:23.708 --> 00:22:24.750
Are you serious?

00:22:27.375 --> 00:22:28.833
Oh my God, Chander!

00:22:29.583 --> 00:22:30.667
I'm so proud of you!

00:22:30.750 --> 00:22:32.958
You're going to Mussoorie
to open Musafir Cafe.

00:22:33.042 --> 00:22:34.708
- I'm so--
- No, no.

00:22:34.792 --> 00:22:35.833
Mumbai.

00:22:37.292 --> 00:22:38.958
- What?
- Yes, Mumbai.

00:22:40.542 --> 00:22:41.708
Look, I'm thinking,

00:22:41.792 --> 00:22:44.917
I'll serve my one-month notice period,
and we'll get a fresh start.

00:22:45.958 --> 00:22:48.875
I'll manage the house for a few days.
You can focus on your job.

00:22:48.958 --> 00:22:51.375
And it's Mumbai, man.
I can easily find a new job.

00:22:51.458 --> 00:22:52.542
One second.

00:22:53.250 --> 00:22:56.458
You quit your job
to come to Mumbai with me?

00:22:56.542 --> 00:22:57.625
Yes.

00:22:57.708 --> 00:23:00.708
You're the one who always says
to follow your dreams.

00:23:00.792 --> 00:23:03.500
Yes, Chander, follow your dreams!

00:23:04.125 --> 00:23:07.500
Your dream isn't to work
a corporate job in Mumbai, right?

00:23:07.583 --> 00:23:10.875
Your dream is to go to the mountains
and open a cafe, isn't it?

00:23:10.958 --> 00:23:13.042
Yes, but you're my dream too, Sudha.

00:23:14.917 --> 00:23:17.417
And dreams can change.
They can evolve.

00:23:18.042 --> 00:23:19.833
Why can't two people's dreams merge?

00:23:20.375 --> 00:23:21.917
I really thought you'd be happy.

00:23:23.875 --> 00:23:26.208
It's my decision. I don't want this job.

00:23:26.292 --> 00:23:28.167
- I'll go with you--
- What are you saying?

00:23:28.708 --> 00:23:31.083
Chander, we just got back
from the mountains.

00:23:31.167 --> 00:23:32.542
You were so happy there.

00:23:32.625 --> 00:23:35.167
You shortlisted plans with Pankaj,

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:37.333
so how did this become
your plan all of a sudden?

00:23:38.542 --> 00:23:39.875
I just want to be with you.

00:23:42.292 --> 00:23:43.958
And is that really so bad?

00:23:44.583 --> 00:23:47.250
Chander,
wanting to be together is not bad.

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:51.542
But moving your whole life to Mumbai
because of me is just--

00:23:51.625 --> 00:23:52.958
Chander!

00:24:07.292 --> 00:24:10.000
You don't like Bhopal,
you don't like Delhi,

00:24:10.083 --> 00:24:12.083
you don't like Mumbai. You…

00:24:13.417 --> 00:24:15.542
You were so happy in the mountains!

00:24:18.167 --> 00:24:19.875
I felt it myself.

00:24:21.750 --> 00:24:24.208
Go to Mussoorie
and open your cafe, Chander.

00:24:24.292 --> 00:24:26.792
We'll manage. I promise.

00:24:31.958 --> 00:24:33.083
One second.

00:25:07.917 --> 00:25:09.708
We should get married.

00:25:10.333 --> 00:25:11.458
What?

00:25:11.542 --> 00:25:13.000
Sudha, think about it.

00:25:13.958 --> 00:25:15.458
Think about it. This is perfect timing.

00:25:16.792 --> 00:25:20.083
Mumbai, the job, marriage, a baby,
maybe this is how it's meant to be!

00:25:20.875 --> 00:25:23.000
This is how it's meant to be, Sudha.

00:25:23.083 --> 00:25:24.083
Marriage?

00:25:26.458 --> 00:25:28.375
- Chander, what are you saying?
- No, I…

00:25:29.292 --> 00:25:31.125
- Yeah, I-- I'm sorry.
- Marriage?

00:25:31.208 --> 00:25:32.792
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry. I…

00:25:33.333 --> 00:25:34.583
I'm sorry.

00:25:35.958 --> 00:25:36.833
Fuck.

00:25:36.917 --> 00:25:39.125
Sudha, wait a minute.
Just talk to me--

00:25:39.208 --> 00:25:40.708
- No, Chander!
- Sudha…

00:25:43.792 --> 00:25:44.750
Sudha!

00:25:45.500 --> 00:25:47.917
Sudha, wait, at least talk to me!

00:25:50.333 --> 00:25:51.667
Let go of me.

00:25:53.208 --> 00:25:54.375
You're hurting me.

00:26:07.458 --> 00:26:10.375
So, goodbye it is then.

00:26:10.917 --> 00:26:12.083
For now.

00:26:12.167 --> 00:26:13.958
No, but I'm really excited for you.

00:26:14.500 --> 00:26:15.958
A new country, new adventures.

00:26:16.917 --> 00:26:18.000
But no Preeti Kaushik.

00:26:20.292 --> 00:26:22.125
All the best for your book launch.

00:26:22.208 --> 00:26:26.500
And next year, Musafir House's
special room will be ready for you.

00:26:27.750 --> 00:26:29.417
Promise me you'll write.

00:26:31.458 --> 00:26:34.750
- My publishers are waiting.
- Only if you promise me to read it first.

00:26:34.833 --> 00:26:36.750
- Deal.
- Deal.

00:30:13.292 --> 00:30:15.292
Subtitle translation by: Neha Nair


